# Leftover Netlify `_redirects` must not be uploaded. Wrangler still
# *parses* dist/_redirects if the file exists (error 100324), so the
# build also deletes dist/ before Vite runs. This ignore is a backup.
_redirects
# Pass 1 review assets are served locally only while Horizon is dev-gated.
# (R1-72: when Horizon ships, serve the chunked definition — world/<revision>.index.json.gz and
# world/<revision>/<district>.json.gz — never the raw world/<revision>.json bake artefact, 27.7 MB > 25 MiB.)
/horizon/**
